  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Uuhh... where can I even go?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974750
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (I can't go be with any of the others, once they eventually meet back
      up with Sayori she'll tell them...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (... wait, {mc} said that we <i>could</i> go work on a farm...)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974751
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (... yeah. Since {mc} said it would be a bad idea, no one will think
      to look for me there.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (They'll think I must've gotten lost, or died-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974752
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (...)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: (Oh god, what am I doing...?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974753
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: <Speed=20>(Ican'tthinkIcan'tthinkIcan'tthinkIcan'tthink-)</Speed>
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Perhaps instinctively, Yuri conjures her dagger once again, preparing
      to cut herself to try and focus.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268099428974754
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
